      "text": [
        " : «إِذَا مَرَرْتَ بِوَادِي مُحَسِّرٍ وَ هُوَ وَادٍ عَظِيمٌ بَيْنَ جَمْعٍ وَ مِنًى وَ هُوَ إِلَى مِنًى أَقْرَبُ فَاسْعَ فِيهِ حَتَّى تُجَاوِزَهُ فَإِنَّ رَسُولَ اَللَّهِ صَلَّى اَللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَ آلِهِ حَرَّكَ نَاقَتَهُ فِيهِ وَ قَالَ « اَللَّهُمَّ سَلِّمْ عَهْدِي وَ اِقْبَلْ تَوْبَتِي وَ أَجِبْ دَعْوَتِي وَ اُخْلُفْنِي بِخَيْرٍ فِيمَنْ تَرَكْتُ بَعْدِي."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.2987 - Mu'awiyah ibn Ammar narrated from Abu Abdullah (as), who said:\n\"When you pass through the Valley of Muhassir—a significant valley between Jam‘ (Muzdalifah) and Mina, closer to Mina—hasten through it until you have crossed it.\nThe Messenger of Allah (swt) (peace be upon him and his family) quickened his camel's pace in this valley and said:\n'O Allah (swt), secure my covenant, accept my repentance, answer my supplication, and bless those I have left behind with goodness after me.'\""
        ]
      }
    },
